### Add a questionnaire
POST {{base}}/embeddings/questionnaire HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

< ./sample_questionnaire.json

### Query a questionnaire
@query = "back pain sample questionnaire"
GET {{base}}/embeddings/questionnaire?query={{query}} HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a questionnaire
@survey_id = 4634fd7c-c988-11ee-b165-8616e5ba1b04
DELETE {{base}}/embeddings/questionnaire/{{survey_id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
